  "sn23.13:1.3": "Aniccam aniccanti bhante vuccati || ",
  "sn23.13:1.4": "katamannu kho bhante aniccanti || || 4 ",
  "sn23.13:1.5": "Rupaṃ kho Rādha aniccaṃ || vedanā aniccā || sañña aniccā || saṅkhārā aniccā || viññāṇam aniccaṃ || || 5 ",
  "sn23.13:1.6": "Evam passaṃ || pe || ",
  "sn23.13:1.7": "nāparam itthattāyāti pajānātīti || || 1-3 ",
  "sn23.13:1.8": "Sāvatthi || || Ekam antaṃ "
}
